📅 Day 52 – JSP Scriptlets & Expressions

Full Stack Web Development with Java Internship

Today’s session focused on JSP scripting elements, specifically scriptlets and expressions. The mentor explained how Java code can be embedded into JSP pages to perform logic and display dynamic content.

🔹 Topics Covered
1️⃣ JSP Scriptlets
Scriptlets allow embedding Java code inside JSP
Used to perform logic operations
🔹 Syntax:
<%
    // Java code
%>
2️⃣ JSP Expressions
Used to display dynamic values directly in the output
Automatically prints the result
🔹 Syntax:
<%= expression %>
3️⃣ Difference Between Scriptlet & Expression
Scriptlet → Used for logic and processing
Expression → Used for displaying output
🔹 Practical Work

During the practice session, I:

Created JSP pages using scriptlets
Performed logic operations using Java code
Used expressions to display dynamic results
Tested dynamic content rendering in browser